      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The OnPlayerTriggerExit event should trigger when the players capsule Collider exits the trigger area. \n\nBut when a player has a seat on his Avatar for other players to sit on the event will not fire for the seated players. Even though they also leave the trigger area.",
