      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Expected result would be that on entering a station (which disables the player collider), Player trigger exit fires.\"\n\nI don't think so. Given the Name \"On Player trigger Exit, does indeed imply, that the player, sitting on a station while IN the trigger Area, the Player is NOT exiting the Area. \n\nThough, when the Station with the Player on on is leaving the Area, the Player Exits that Area also, and therefore the event should fire.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
